      "content": "i guess. but it feels more than just being overwhelmed. it feels more like... why force it? if the universe doesn't care and none of this leaves a mark, isn't continuing the struggle just a way of fighting against the inevitable? it feels almost irrational to keep trying when the outcome is always just more nothingness.",
